  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1968\">\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1752\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1750\">CD3/CD8/CD45:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1968\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1859\">\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1859\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Increased <strong data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1790\">T-cell percentages</strong> may indicate <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1856\">inflammation, infection, or lymphoma involvement</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1968\">\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1968\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1873\">CD45</strong> confirms <strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1922\">leukocytic vs non-leukocytic origin</strong> (helps identify malignant vs reactive cells).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2164\">\n<p data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1989\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1987\">C4 Levels:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2164\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2098\">\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2098\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Low levels can be seen in <strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2075\">immune complex-mediated diseases (SLE, vasculitis)</strong> even in body fluids.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2164\">\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2164\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Compare with <strong data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2133\">serum levels</strong> for meaningful interpretation.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2265\">\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2204\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Final diagnosis should integrate:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2265\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2265\">\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2265\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2265\">Cytology, cultures, imaging, and clinical findings.</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
